    "design": "Unblinded randomized trial with assignment in a 1:1 ratio. Analysis was by intention to treat. The primary outcome was the number of days without mechanical ventilation in a 28-day period.",
    "population": "Of 428 patients assessed for eligibility, 140 critically ill adults who were undergoing mechanical ventilation and expected to need ventilation for more than 24 hours were enrolled. Assignment was no sedation (n=70) or sedation with daily interruption (n=70). After 27 patients who died or were successfully extubated within 48 hours were excluded from the statistical analysis, 55 patients remained in the no-sedation group and 58 in the interrupted-sedation group.",
